  'delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 10,
    guideRating: 4.92,
    valueRating: 4.92,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Henk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "This tour was amazing and very well organized by India Day Trip. The team took care of all accommodations, transport, tickets and planning, and was in constant contact with me, drivers and guides to ensure my comfort and smooth operations. As a customer, the only thing I had to do every day was to enjoy the sights, the landscape, the wildlife, the cultural learnings and the great food. It was a beautiful trip. Highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/8676906/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/8676907/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/8676908/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Amarnah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-26", text: "I think that all the places i stayed at were good, tidy, odour free. You will need about 20,000 INR in gratitudes as they expect 1k a day, you will have a driver and a tour guide most the time so it is 2k INR a day in gratitudes. Plus personal expenses. All up i spent 30k INR in across the 7 days, this was gratitudes, entry tickets and food. The sleeper train from Agra to Varanasi was sketchy as a solo female traveller I didn’t get a much sleep was too anxious and didn’t feel that safe on the train. The train from Varanasi to Delhi was clean and felt far safer. Keep in mind that India is very crowded, very busy, the streets aren’t clean and often have litter and people peeing in random public places. Do not litter and put your rubbish in bins that you find along the way or keep it until you return to your accomodation. It is a place full of rich history and some amazing architecture, remember to respect these places to allow others to also appreciate their beauty", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/5628458/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/5628459/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/5628460/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "The whole trip from start to finish was just outstanding. All well thought through, planned and delivered expertly. Every hotel was exemplary, all guides fantastic, informative and clear. Our biggest thanks goes to our tour leader Anshul they are available 24 hr who kept us comfortable, safe and in good spirits on the crazy roads of India.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/6449022/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/6449023/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/6449024/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Alessia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-29", text: "Il viaggio è stato molto ben organizzato: l’autista era sempre disponibile e ci portava ovunque con puntualità, mentre le guide nei vari monumenti parlavano in italiano e si sono rivelate preparate e gentili. Il tour permetteva di visitare molti luoghi diversi senza stress, e gli hotel scelti erano davvero belli. Unico piccolo inconveniente: in alcune strutture, la camera tripla prevedeva un materasso invece di un vero letto aggiuntivo. A causa delle numerose prenotazioni per il safari, l’itinerario è stato modificato, ma l’agenzia ha gestito tutto con efficienza. Sarebbe utile avere una descrizione più dettagliata del tour prima della partenza. L’ultimo giorno c’è stato un disguido con l’orario del trasferimento in aeroporto, subito risolto grazie alla cortesia e disponibilità dell’agenzia. Nel complesso, esperienza positiva e consigliata!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/4431861/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/4431862/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-7-days-golden-triangle-with-tiger-safari-var/4431863/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Dawid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Fantastic tour of India! The experience in India was truly wonderful. We enjoyed the country's royal heritage and visited delhi, agra , ranthambore, Jaipur and varanasi. where we had the opportunity to witness this regal culture up close. Although we didn't spot any tigers in Ranthambore, we had the chance to see herds of deer, Sambar deer, eagles, and langurs. Finally, we visited Agra—the city of love—and saw its famous monuments. All accommodation arrangements were excellent, and the driver as well as all the guides were professional and friendly." },
      { author: "Gabriele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "Really great experience. Very good hotel accommodation and dinner. Professional guide in the city. Support during the tour, and above all a very friendly and professional driver, Tikam was great!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "Our tour was excellently organized from start to finish. Everything was perfectly arranged, yet we still had plenty of free time to explore at our own pace. Our tour operator, Anshul, did a fantastic job and ensured we stayed at the best 5-star hotels throughout the trip. The guides in each city were knowledgeable and professional, making our sightseeing experiences both enjoyable and informative. Our driver, Omveer, was incredibly helpful, polite, and kind; he always ensured we had water and that our journey was comfortable. During the tour, we visited Delhi, Agra, Jaipur, and Varanasi, and enjoyed a tiger safari in Ranthambore. My wife, children, and I thoroughly enjoyed every moment of the trip. We were lucky enough to spot a tiger during the safari, enjoyed an early morning boat ride in Varanasi, and even traveled on an Indian train—it was truly a memorable experience. I would highly recommend this tour to anyone looking for a magnificent and hassle-free experience in India." },
      { author: "Giovanni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "Esperienza fantastica. Tutto organizzato in ogni particolare. guide e autisti super. supporto h 24. consigliatissimo" },
    ],
  },
