  'delhi-market-street-food-walk-half-day-women-led': {
    averageRating: 4.85,
    totalReviews: 7,
    guideRating: 4.85,
    valueRating: 4.85,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Isabella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "I loved the entire evening. I was welcomed and shown around Old Delhi by Neha and Aman. The shops in Chandini Chowk were incredible and the food tasting was delicious. I sampled samosas, masala chai, the best chicken kebabs. To finish we tasted bread pudding and kheer. I bought a pashmina and some decorative envelopes for gifts. Aman’s knowledge of Old Delhi really helped to put this beautiful city into context. Excellent tour. Highly recommended.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-market-street-food-walk-half-day-women-led/4810392/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-market-street-food-walk-half-day-women-led/4810400/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-market-street-food-walk-half-day-women-led/4810407/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sharon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "Everything was brilliant, well looked after. Food tasting was great, loads of different stops and various options offered. We did some shopping as well, bought Sarees and a ring, nothing was too much trouble. We travelled to lots of different parts by car then walked safely through busy markets and area. Both driver and guide were very knowledgeable and both were great company, went above and beyond as we finished late due to shopping. A great evening, thank you" },
      { author: "Dhruti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-30", text: "This was an amazing tour and we managed to go to the selected spots where I wanted to go. All the food spots were 10/10 and it was such a relaxed and enjoyable night" },
      { author: "Lorraine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "Farheen and Ardeel were very professional friendly and helpful- they gave me a New Delhi experience that I never would have had being a single female traveller. I enjoyed my time and would highly recommend to anyone. Thank you so much both of you - see you both next time." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "Farheen and the driver was amazing, very nice made me feel very confident and comfortable during the whole tour, all the food places had a food better then the before. And the cherry on top was the fabric factory where I could find nice saris. I totally recommend the tour." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-06-27", text: "とても満足できました。" },
    ],
  },
