  'delhi-personalized-shopping-tour-with-female-exper': {
    averageRating: 4.55,
    totalReviews: 8,
    guideRating: 4.55,
    valueRating: 4.55,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "Had a wonderful Delhi shopping tour with our guide, Shikha. She was knowledgeable, friendly, and took us to the best local markets with great deals. The experience met all my expectations and was smooth and enjoyable. The organizer kept in touch throughout and made sure I had everything I needed—highly recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-personalized-shopping-tour-with-female-exper/5904996/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-personalized-shopping-tour-with-female-exper/5904997/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-personalized-shopping-tour-with-female-exper/5904998/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Alayna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-16", text: "Shailja was such a sweet and knowledgeable guide. Expert in history and a great bargainer. I hope to do more tours with her.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-personalized-shopping-tour-with-female-exper/4636934/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "Excellent. Very personalized. Felt very safe. Friendly and very knowledgeable." },
      { author: "Putri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "It’s really great to spent time shopping with Shailja. She’s really helpful to find me a nice saaree and kurta." },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-12-18", text: "It was easy to book, guide was on time and helpful throughout the day. she knew a lot of markets to choose from. I think the only thing to add would be to have some interesting facts about why we went to certain places. I felt unsure what to request as I don't know dehli very well so, being asked where do you want to go I wasn't really sure how to answer. would be awesome to add some places that are a bit quirky and unusual eg places specialising in bone, silver or bizarre artifacts. anyways would recommend :)" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-17", text: "Sweet Astha sharma and habib were very nice, they took care of me to make sure I was safe all the time … I will highly recommend them since I was a solo travel and they make sure I was safe and happy … thank you so kivj for the great. Experience.. till next time" },
      { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-19", text: "Shikha hat einen hervorragenden Job gemacht. Die Shopping-Tour war bestens organisiert und genau auf meine Wünsche abgestimmt. Wir waren bei einem sehr guten Schneider, bei dem ich mir ein neues Jackett anfertigen lasse, und ich habe hochwertige Kaschmir-Pullover gefunden. Zusätzlich haben wir Tee, Gewürze und einige schöne Mitbringsel gekauft. Besonders angenehm war, dass es keinerlei Verkaufsdruck gab – Shikha hat nur empfohlen und sich im Hintergrund gehalten, wenn ich mir Zeit zum Entscheiden nehmen wollte. Man merkt, dass sie die richtigen Adressen kennt und Qualität von Touristenfallen unterscheiden kann. Insgesamt eine sehr entspannte, effiziente und erfolgreiche Shopping-Tour. Absolute Empfehlung." },
    ],
  },
  'delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-11", text: "This was an incredible private tour! As a solo woman traveler I felt very safe with my driver and guides, and I learned so much along the 3-day experience. Each guide was super knowledgeable and helpful in making my trip memorable and enjoyable. I would highly recommend booking this experience to others!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/5454514/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/5454517/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/5454518/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Amazing sites, guides where all amazing. My driver was an absolute legend. 10 out 10 recommend for all.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/8370188/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/8370189/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-3-day-golden-triangle-tour-with-fema/8370190/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "Driver was good, guides very knowledgable on history of various monuments and hotel selections were great. The 3 day tour is unfortunately somewhat rushed so tended to be exhausting. If you keep the 3 day option, you need to help the client select only the best ones depending on their interest as one runs out of time and is forced to cut out some of the locations so as not to get to the next destination too late in the evening, even if you started out early the morning from the previous one. Limiting vehicle maximum speed is understandably a safety consideration but it could help to make that limit at least that of the road. Driving at a maximum speed of 80km/hour when the road speed limit is 100 km/hr makes the road trip somewhat longer and exhausting." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Everything was perfectly organized and both the guides and the driver were kind, helpful and well prepared. The hotels were great and the schedule not too tight, so you had the time to enjoy all the monuments but also to explore the cities on your own in the late afternoon and evening!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "It was great. The driver , Ashok , can converse in English, which is important because he was with us for the whole 3 days journey. Ashok is like a second tour guide for us. He knows very well where we can have our lunch , snacks and to stop for toilet use while we were in the expressway. Overall I’m very impressed and satisfied in this tour." },
    ],
  },
