  'elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 23,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jasdeep", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-24", text: "I had an amazing experience, my time with Shaboo was extraordinary, I loved every moment The organic colours were a lot of fun and then to was it off , shaboo drenched me which was great as it was a hot day The caretakers and drivers and guides were all lovely I would definitely recommend this experience to any animal lover 10/10", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/5923438/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/5923439/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/5923440/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "everything well organized from pick up to elefun farm/institute. Very friendly People, they treat you not as a tourist but like a part of team. we appreciate the contact with Shobha ( éléphant), baban, moin and aftab.Activities are feeding, washing and go for a walk around an clean environment. thank you soon much for this unique expérience. Christophe", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/8693642/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/8693644/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-03", text: "Die Elefanten Tour war sehr gut organisiert, mein Hotel lag weiter von der Stadt entfernt, dies stellte kein Problem dar. Angekommen habe ich Sie selbst gefüttert, angemalt, gewaschen und ihr ein Dessert gegegeben. Dies war eine einmalige Aktion, so etwas mal gemacht zu haben. Kann es nur weiter empfehlen.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/4067179/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Noelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-24", text: "Increíble, una experiencia mágica! Súper recomendables! Primero llegamos nos explicaron sobre los elefantes, nos conocimos con ellos, les dimos de comer, luego hicimos una caminata con ellos, los pintamos con pintura natural, los bañamos y por último le dimos su postre (bananas)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/1143243/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/1143244/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/1143245/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "stefania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-26", text: "Fue increíble poder tener la oportunidad de ser parte de unas horas de cuidado de Shabbo. Una elefante de 33 años rescatada de un circo. Se la veia muy feliz , energética y juguetona. Se nota que la cuidan y ella esta super agradecida. La organizacion fue muy buena, te buscan y te dejan en un punto en Jaipur ya que el lugar se encuentra a 30 min de la ciudad. Te reciben con bebidas y tenes la oportunidad de estar todo el tiempo que desees. Super recomendable!!! No lo duden ! 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/944558/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/944559/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/944560/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Olga", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-17", text: "Eine super Erfahrung, Elefantendame wird da richtig gut betreut", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/elefun-elephant-sanctuary-tour-in-jaipur/724552/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kamil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-11", text: "It was a wonderful time spent with a majestic and beautiful female elephant. The staff helps feeding the animal, gives hints on how to do it so that the elephant feels comfortable. We could also take it for a walk and spend as much time with the elephant as we wanted without any rush. It was a unique experience 🤗" },
      { author: "Jo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-27", text: "Loved meeting the elephants and learning how they are cared for. Elephant painting was a highlight!" },
      { author: "Christina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-30", text: "The experience was just as described, we were picked up from our hotel after making this request to elefun. we went to the elephant village where there are a number of elephant companies who mostly offer a ride around the village. elefun is a registered sanctuary and we didn't ride the elephant. we had great explanation of the elephants ages and temperaments . we fed the lovely elephant and bonded with her then painted and showered her. we were given lovely hospitality with drinks and then driven home. we loved everything." },
      { author: "Sievwright", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-14", text: "This was exactly what we wanted, the people was very welcoming and knowledgeable with the elephants and they clearly had a great bond with them which was great to see. This was everything I was expecting and more, would fully recommend doing if you’re in jaipur and want to have a great time with elephants" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "Eine fantastische Erfahrung: Rohini erlaubte mir sie zu bemalen , zu duschen, mit ihr spazieren zu gehen und sie zu füttern. Auf ihrem Hals zu sitzen war bezaubernd schön! Die Betreuer sprechen gut Englisch und erklären sehr gut die Bedürfnisse der Elefanten. Einfach toll!" },
      { author: "Felipe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "Recomiendo demasiado este tour, el guía nos sacó unos videos y fotografías excelentes y la experiencia con el ejemplar fue perfecta. Todo excelente." },
    ],
  },
