    reviews: [
      { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "Salim was very knowledgeable on all of the facts on Taj Mahal, he took some great picture for us.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/8248688/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-16", text: "Salim khan was a knowledgeable and friendly guide. Breathtaking views at the Taj Mahal. In addition, Rahul was a safe and reliable driver.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6692997/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Vanja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "We had Danish as our guide. He was such a nice guy and we really enjoyed our day with him on this trip to Agra. For us it was important to get some time alone to just take it all in and get some nice photos. Danish both gave us time alone on several occasions and also helped us with taking photos. He told stories about the places we visited and gave us good insight with the story behind the monuments. Our lunch was amazing! Would 10/10 recommend this tour to others ☺️", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6241466/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6241467/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6241468/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "We had a very pleasant tour in taj Mahal and Baby taj Mahal. The guide Salim Khan was very good. He explained very detailed all the curiosities and answered to all our questions. The pickup and drop off were smooth, we had a clean and tidy car with AC. We are very satisfied and reccomend this tour! :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/6072261/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ronit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "Javed Khan is the best. Good explanation and good 👍 vibes thank you so much ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️ we had a photographer with us that took pictures of us . At the very charming palace in the world One of the seven wonders ……….. ……… ………. …….. …………………………………………….", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/5243201/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-11", text: "Faizan (our guide) and Rahul (our driver) were great. We had an amazing time with both. Faizan explained everything and took us some great pictures too!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4879268/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4879269/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4879270/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Wang", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-15", text: "Faizan is a kind, caring tour guide, introduced the story, history to us, also cares about feelings. You can feel chill if you have a chance to let him be your tour guide. Really enjoyed this good trip, Taj Mahal.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4627580/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4627581/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Shannon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-19", text: "We had a wonderful tour with Javed Khan and his team! (Hasan and Amir). They were so friendly, patient and gave us great information. We would recommend them to anyone planning to go on this excursion - it is a MUST! Thank you!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4290870/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4290871/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4290872/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Agda Almada", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "I had an amazing tour! Hassan picked me up at 2:30 am from my hotel, when I got to find out that I was going to have a private tour. He's an extrovert driver that was showing and explaining about all the existing main monuments/tourist attraction along our way to Agra. After arriving in Agra, I was greeted by my tour guide, Javed Khan. OMG, where do I begin!? Javed was an excellent guide, who meticulously explained Taj Mahal's history. And here comes the best part; Javed is also a great photographer. He took plenty of incredible pictures of me from different angles. We then proceeded to Agra Fort, baby taj Mahal, marble crafting center, and cachemere production center. I highly recommend this tour, and the tour guides.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4250404/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4250445/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Neung", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "Salim khan is being a guide for more than 20years. He knew every stone in Agra. Salim show me the good angle of photography. He even took my phone and took very good photo i don’t even have to ask. He is the real deal", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4249281/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4249282/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4249283/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-05", text: "Salim khan has been a fabulous guide for our day trip to Agra, visiting the Taj Mahal and Baby Taj. Very generous with his sharing of history, architecture, art and storytelling. Our driver Mehboob has also been a wonderful part of the team. It is a delight to share stories of our respective lives as well along the way. Thankyou for a truly memorable day and experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4095376/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Phiên", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-02", text: "Salim Khan Mobi was incredibly knowledgeable and friendly. They shared fascinating stories about the history and culture, making the trip both educational and enjoyable. Always attentive to the group’s needs, they ensured everything went smoothly. Truly a wonderful experience thanks to their guidance!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-5/4053162/1600.webp"] },
    ],
