  'from-delhiagra-taj-mahal-tour-with-rental-saree-ex': {
    averageRating: 2.96,
    totalReviews: 2,
    guideRating: 2.96,
    valueRating: 2.96,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Chiho", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-18", text: "ガイドのタンビールさんは日本語が堪能で、とても紳士的でツアーについても私たちの希望を叶えてくれました。 日本語で説明してもらえるので、タージマハルについても良くわかりました！ ツアーの終わりには大理石や宝石などお土産のお店にも連れて行ってもらえます。買わないと出られないというようなプレッシャーはないですが、インドらしいディスカウントありのショッピングも楽しむことができます笑 とにかく、タンビールさんがイケメンで優しくてグッドガイで素晴らしいので、タージマハルをみたいなら絶対におすすめのツアーです！", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhiagra-taj-mahal-tour-with-rental-saree-ex/7627142/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhiagra-taj-mahal-tour-with-rental-saree-ex/7627146/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhiagra-taj-mahal-tour-with-rental-saree-ex/7627152/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-07-27", text: "日本人の皆さん、このツアーには本当に気を付けてください。サリー体験付きとなっていますが、別料金です。私は途中でキャンセルしましたが、何度も連絡が来て断っても何度もすすめられ、参加後に料金を支払っていいからと言われ、やはり一人じゃ不安になりキャンセルしましたが、それでもカードから2万円以上の参加費が引き落としされていました。説明文も対応も非常に不親切ですし、かなり説得されて断れない状況にさせます。他のガイドをさがしてください。" },
    ],
  },
  'from-delhiagrajaipur-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-opti': {
    averageRating: 4.6,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 4.6,
    valueRating: 4.6,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-18", text: "금요일에는 타지마할이 열지 않아서 아쉬웠어요. 사리를 꼭 입어여하는 것 같아요.많아 비쌌어요. 아그라 포트와 베이비 타지마할에서 설명을 잘해주셨어요.사진도 아주 열심히 찍어주셨습니다. 끝나고는 주얼리 투어인듯,판매인듯하는 코스가 있습니다.혼자보다는 친구와 함께를 추천해요", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhiagrajaipur-taj-mahal-agra-tour-with-opti/7633478/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-27", text: "Excellent tour! My driver Prince was waiting for me for our 2 AM start. He was a great driver and the car was well air conditioned and stocked with water. We arrived in Agra and met my guide Arman. He was very knowledgeable, friendly and a good conversationalist. We visited the scheduled sites and I was able to add visits to Akbar’s Tomb and Fatehpur Sikri. If you have the time, I’d highly recommend adding those to your itinerary. At Fatehpur Sikri I had a new guide named Adnan who knew everything about the site and kept us in the shade as much as possible during the hot day. Overall I’d highly recommend this day trip from Delhi!" },
    ],
  },
  'from-jaipur-2-day-ranthambore-national-park-safari': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "I had a great trip out to Ranthambore. Even though I didn't see a tiger. Did see antelope, deer, monkeys. Had one safari in cantor and the other in Jeep. My accomadation was fabulous, it was brand new and clean. Best sleep ever. My driver Suni was great, he drove so safely, the car was so clean. He was happy to tell me about the India culture. He ensured my safety at all times. A great tour." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "Mr Singh was an excellent chauffeur, friendly, professional, and made the whole trip seamless. The 2-day tour was perfectly organized with comfortable transport, a smooth hotel stay in a beautiful resort and two well-timed safaris. I was lucky to see tigers twice, along with bears, deer, crocodiles, turtles, antelopes, and many colorful birds. An exceptional and unforgettable wildlife experience—highly recommended! 🐅 The car was comfortable with ac and leather interior, water bottles were also provided freely by Mr Singh. Everything has been planned in advance by Mr Singh. I highly recommend this 2days tour!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-13", text: "." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "Pradeep was an amazing chauffeur, cook, photographer, and travel companion! Also got lucky seeing tigers twice on the safari. Couldn't have wished for any better 2 days spent!" },
    ],
  },
