  'from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa': {
    averageRating: 3.68,
    totalReviews: 55,
    guideRating: 3.55,
    valueRating: 3.41,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-07", text: "La Guida del parco parlava un inglese incomprensibile.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/1762101/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/1762102/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/1762103/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Virginie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-07-09", text: "The pick up time was set up at 9am. At 9:20 am after waiting outside of the hotel, we received a text message saying the tour starts at 10 am because it takes maximum 3 hours to go to the park. Finally at 10am the driver was still not here because they did a mistake in the location picking point. We left at 10:20 and arrived at 2:20 pm!!! So 4 hours to arrive to the meeting point, the Safari started at 3:15 pm so we ate something quickly to be on time. The Safari was very nice even if we didn’t seen tiger (probabilities to see one is very low) it was great and we saw a lot of animals. The way back was better. Concerning the car, the seatbelt was not functioning on the back of the car, and the windshield was broken.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/688512/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/688513/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/688514/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nancy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-04-20", text: "The drive was very scary from Jaipur especially the return at night . I was scared for my life! Everyone knows you will NOT see tigers in mid day!!! They only eat once a month. This tour is a tour of deer only and is false advertising", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/375288/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/375289/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/375290/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Chádia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-01", text: "Um dia inesquecível que vi 4 tigres em um safari agendado pela plataforma da Get Your Guide!!! Maravilhoso! 👏🏾", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/312559/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/312560/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/312561/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Abraham", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-01", text: "La actividad ha ido según lo previsto. Nadeem me recogió en el aeropuerto y después de 3h, comimos en un restaurante para, seguidamente montarme al Safari. Entre la comida y el inicio del Safari, nos dio tiempo a visitar un mercado típico en Ramthambore. Tuve la muy buena suerte de avistar a tres tigres casi acabando el safari (por estas fechas no suele ser lo normal). Ni que decir tiene que había una fauna muy entrañable, cocodrilos, aves a doquier, tortugas, gato de selva, cerbatillos… Al acabar Nadeem me dejó en mi hotel en Jaipur. Recomiendo mucho esta experiencia! El personal que gestionó toda la actividad fue muy amable, cercana y atenta.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/181939/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa/181940/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "MacKenzie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-10", text: "I saw a tiger! For those wondering, the car ride is 4 hours. My driver was Nadine, we left at 10am and returned at 10:30pm. There's a washroom break an hour before arriving at the park and another washroom at the park in case you want to know like myself. Ac car the whole way, I'm used to long car rides so this was worth the drive." },
      { author: "Jilly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-06", text: "Tour Travel and Transportation were excellent in making all the arrangements and contacting us. Our driver Nadeem Khan was a careful and professional driver and very knowledgeable. He even found us some chai to drink while we waiting for the jeep to take us into the safari park. Very very happy to have been in such good hands" },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-16", text: "The whole tour was great. Our driver Nadeem, was very kind. Very knowledgeable and easy to communicate with. We could not have had a better experience! The tiger safari itself was also great! The safari guides were very knowledgeable and we saw a tiger at the very last minute! Our guides made sure we were all able to see it before leaving." },
      { author: "Mindaugas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-17", text: "Nadim was perfect driver. I loved his service and extra places he showed was nice" },
      { author: "Bill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-12", text: "The activity was great! We were very lucky to see 4 tigers (a mother and cubs). Nadim, our driver from the hotel was lovely and looked after us both ways. The experience overall was really good and I’d recommend it" },
      { author: "Virginia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-16", text: "The organization for pick up at the hotel and gate was very easy via WhatsApp. We had the chance to choose the Gate number 3 for entrance, because we heard it might be the best one for seeing tigers. Even it was the Canter (because Gypsy was booked out for weeks) we where lucky to see the tiger. Our driver was also very friendly." },
      { author: "Phoebe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-24", text: "Sam was amazing!! Had so much information to share and made sure we had everything we needed! Such a good day out!!" },
    ],
  },
