  'from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 31,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.89,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-25", text: "I was fortunate to have the support of two exceptional professionals during my time in Jaipur. Gaurav Bhatt, my guide, was outstanding: a true expert in the history, culture, and spirituality of the Pink City. He presented each palace, fort, and temple with clarity, enthusiasm, and a deep respect for local traditions. His knowledge and warm hospitality made every visit meaningful. Rahul Yadav, who drove me from Delhi to Jaipur, was punctual, patient, and incredibly courteous. He ensured a smooth and safe journey, making the long drive comfortable and pleasant. I wholeheartedly recommend both Gaurav and Rahul to anyone looking to explore Jaipur and Rajasthan with insight, comfort, and peace of mind.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2210856/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2210857/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2210858/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-05", text: "Es war ein langer aber sehr schöner Tag. Der Guide sprach fliessend Deutsch und konnte unsere Fragen beantworten. Das Mittagessen war oke, wir haben mit Buffet gebucht.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2079312/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2079314/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/2079315/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-26", text: "Ο ξεναγός μας Nawal ήταν εξαιρετικός αναλυτικός και με γνώσεις της ιστορίας της καθε περιοχής και μνημείου που επισκεφτήκαμε!ηταν περιποιητικός και με χαμόγελο μας απαντούσε σε κάθε ερώτηση μας.τον συστήνουμε και θα τον αναζητήσουμε αν ξανάρθουμε στην junior👍", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/1360522/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-new-delhi-jaipur-private-day-trip-with-guide/1360523/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Dawid", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-02", text: "Harsh Vardhan Singh Jaipur was the best tourguide in Jaipur with great knowledge of the city - seriously recommend" },
      { author: "Margarida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-13", text: "Our guide was extremely knowledgeable and gave us a good knowledge of Jaipur, and all the spots we visited We also had a good pace during the day as my mum was present and we had time to visit, learn, eat and shop. Our guide also accommodated 2 friends that also were walking around and was very kind to the whole group. Thanks Harsh Vardhan for the wonderful day out" },
      { author: "Brandon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-10", text: "I was told by friends that Jaipur is an amazing city, but I had no idea how special its history and culture is. Harsh was an amazing guide that shared all of the intricate details that brought the sites to life. Definitely recommend taking this tour." },
      { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-27", text: "Kamal was an amazing guide very passionate and very informative - lots of jokes and made the day fun and learning at the same time. Suresh was a brilliant safe driver and when my son left his phone in the car he was very obliging in returning the phone. He drove long hours and we felt safe at all times. One comment I would make is although the time flew in the car and we enjoyed seeing India in a different light and a lot of India the time spent in the car we underestimated. Totally recommend this tour and we loved Jaipur so will definitely be back and use the company for future tours. Very happy customers" },
      { author: "Oleg", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-20", text: "We really liked our trip to Jajpur. First- we had a nice and careful driver who made our trip safe. We could learn a lot about the country side while traveling. And we enjoyed an amazing guide who shared so much about site and country history, was sensitive to our needs and helped to take great pictures to have memories. The old palace was fascinating in terms of design and location. The city, the castle on the water, the new palace were worth visiting too. The astronomical observatory with its remarkable stone assemblies that help to interpret the position of celestial bodies and calculate local time is really unique. On top of that - visiting a local traditional carpet manufacturer and precious stone shop added to the flavor of discovering local craftsmanship. Al in all - a rewarding trip" },
      { author: "Lin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-27", text: "Gupta is an amazing guide. He is interesting that he told a lot of stories to make us laugh. Additionally, he took a good care of us for not letting others bother us and also tried so hard to fulfill our wish to see the wind palace. He’s the best guide I’ve ever met!" },
      { author: "Phenelope", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-06-07", text: "Loved everything about this trip. The driver, the guide, the experience- everything was well organized. Highly recommended. Nabal our guide guide is a wonderful photographer as well, he was well-informed and was able to give ample information about all monuments, places and culture." },
      { author: "Mohit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-05-29", text: "The private tour of Jaipur from was fantastic. The history and culture are preserved so well, this is a must-see for anyone visiting India. Our guide, Aman was incredibly knowledgable and made the tour very fun and informative. He made a five hour trip to Jaipur in a blink. He even took special attention to ensure our car was comfortable and that we felt safe throughout the journey. Our driver Satish for the day was the utmost professional and the car was perfect. I highly recommend the private tour to Jaipur." },
      { author: "Vania", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-01-21", text: "The tour was great. our tour guide had a wealth of knowledge and was very accommodating. the meal was very good very unexpected, very opulent. The driver was a lovely chapter but the wrong turn and extra hour travel took a tole on us as its was already a long trip. using GPS would have stopped this from happening. Overall the trip was great great. Our tour guide was fab." },
    ],
  },
