    reviews: [
      { author: "Karin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-18", text: "I just ended my tour of the Golden Triangle and Varanasi as a solo traveller. I booked a private tour with Arsal. From start to finish, the experience was exceptional. Arsal was incredibly quick to respond to every message and flexible in adjusting the itinerary to fit my wishes. I had my own driver and in each city a knowledgeable local guide, which made the entire journey feel smooth, safe and personalized. Whether it was navigating the busy streets of Delhi, exploring the beauty of Jaipur’s palaces, experiencing the awe of the Taj Mahal in Agra or witnessing the spiritual atmosphere of Varanasi, everything was perfectly organized. Arsal’s attention to detail and consistent support made the trip effortless and unforgettable. If you’re planning to travel to India, I highly recommend booking with him. It was one of the best decisions I made for this trip!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-tour-with-varanasi-spiritual-journ/4663279/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-tour-with-varanasi-spiritual-journ/4663280/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/golden-triangle-tour-with-varanasi-spiritual-journ/4663281/1600.webp"] },
    ],
