  'heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 195,
    guideRating: 4.96,
    valueRating: 4.94,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Abhijit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "the guide was very knowledgeable and he had a lot of information to share with us. Kumar knew the streets of the pink City very well and took us to a lot of different sights to see. He is able to tailor the tour to your preference, and if you don't have one, he is able to create a fun experience regardless! would recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714225/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714226/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714227/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Susana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "The Tour was excellent. Highly recomended For Foodies And people interested in Indian Culture.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5350055/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5350056/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "Vivek met us in good time for the tour, he has an engaging presence and put everyone at ease before taking us through the alleyways of the city and telling us interesting stories and history. We stopped at many food vendors and we were happy to follow Vivek’s lead on what to choose and he explained clearly recipes and background to the dishes. My family and I all had a lovely day and were well fed", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5047396/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-28", text: "Vivek is an incredible man and guide. He knows Jaipur inside out and gave me a very engaging, relaxed and amazing tour across the old city. As a female solo traveler and only one on the tour I felt very very safe and relaxed with him and got to see and taste so many things and talk to sweet and friendly people, which I would not had the chance to without him. I strongly recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5025437/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5025447/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5025451/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Pawel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "This tour was incredible! Vivek took us all around the markets, and we got the chance to try about 15 different food items at maybe six separate stops, which is much more than we expected, and we are quite full by the end! All along the route, he made a point to stop and share history of nearby architecture, cultural information, and also introduce us to various artisans and craftsman at work in the area. Highly recommend this tour and guide! Definitely a highlight of our visit to Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5014757/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5014759/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/5014761/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Katherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-24", text: "This tour was incredible! Vivek took us all around the markets and we got the chance to try about 15 different food items at maybe 6 separate stops, which was much more than we expected and we were quite full by the end! All along the route he made a point to stop and share history of nearby architecture, cultural information and also introduce us to various artisans and craftsmen at work in the area. Highly recommend this tour and guide! Definitely a highlight of our visit to Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4985700/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4985701/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4985702/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "This was one of the best food and walking tours I had! We visited many places that I would have never seen alone, tasted many delicious snacks (all of them are safe for foreigners to eat) and the guide told Vivik told interesting stories. I enjoyed it very much, also as a female solo traveller.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4739279/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4739280/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4739281/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Chesney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "We had an amazing time exploring Jaipur with Pushpendra, he was very kind and welcoming. It was a great mix of local food and history, Pushpendra was so knowledgeable about all the monuments and was clearly passionate about his work! He was also very open to talking about all subjects and gave us a great insight into Indian life and culture!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/4693430/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "I went on a food tour and I had a great time. The guide is very nice person, it was really comfortable, like we were friends, we chatted on a different topics and of course tried different local street food. Can definitely recommend" },
      { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Excellent fun. This is our second street food tour whilst in India and our favourite. Food was good, information was excellent and the city is great. Would recommend this to anyone coming to Jaipur.." },
      { author: "Inigo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "This was the absolute highlight of our holiday and the best experience we had on our trip to India. It felt like seeing Jaipur with a friend. Vivek was so brilliant, knowledgeable and kind. It really felt like we saw the heart and soul of Jaipur and understood so much more about this beautiful city. The tour was super flexible around what we were interested in and we ended up asking Vivek to spend a whole extra day with us to see the main monuments and go to the extra places and shops we wanted to see - totally worth every penny and more. Vivek even helped arrange travel for our next destination and provided contacts in the next city we were staying in. We felt so lucky and couldn’t recommend this tour enough - thank you Vivek!" },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Incredible experience. We were lucky to have a private tour with Vivek. Great customer service and he even saved us from having to sort out our travel to Agra. You have to do this!!" },
    ],
  },
