  'jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 23,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Achraf", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ An Amazing Experience with Akram! I had an absolutely wonderful experience in Jaipur, and a huge part of that was thanks to my guide, Akram. He is extremely knowledgeable about Jaipur’s history and its most beautiful spots. He explained everything in great detail and made the experience really interesting and enjoyable. What I didn’t expect at all was that Akram is also an amazing photographer! He took some of the best photos of me during my trip, which was such a lovely surprise. Beyond the tour itself, I really enjoyed spending time with him. He was so friendly, helpful, and easygoing that it honestly felt like I was spending the day with someone I had known for a long time. He helped me with everything, even when I wanted to buy a kurta in the bazaars. The driver was also super friendly, very patient, and drove safely throughout the day. The car was clean, comfortable, and had great AC. I highly recommend this experience and especially Akram as a guide! If you want some", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/8698594/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-09", text: "My 2 day tour around Jaipur was delightful. My Guide K K was friendly with a good knowledge of English. The tour itself was very varied with a good selection of attractions visited. My driver Suresh made it easy with a comfortable car as conditions were very hot. Thanks again, recommended", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/6583932/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/6583933/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/6583935/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Stacey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Our guide KK and driver Suresh were amazing! KK was incredibly knowledgeable about the history of each location we went to, and showed us things we definitely wouldn’t have noticed on our own. They were also very accommodating in terms of stopping for lunch when/where we wanted to. Overall I’d highly recommend this tour and working with KK and Suresh.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/4649660/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/4649661/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/4649664/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-29", text: "We had a great 2 days with K.K and Suresh seeing the sights of Jaipur. K.K had great knowledge and took some fantastic photos. Super accommodating and flexible when I was ill on the first day. Would definitely recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/2469530/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Orlando", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-10", text: "Really great! Your without pushing us like other guides sometimes. We did do everything what was expected and the drive was safe and in a good car. Guide is explaining well about all the buildings. Our guide was Narendra and our driver Suresh. Thanks for the nice trip!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/1613948/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/1613949/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/1613950/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "The driver Suresh and the guide Kk made this 2 day private tour in Jaipur just great. Kk was full of knowledge and knew the exact amount of explaining, not less, not too much. He build the tour with logic and personality he was a great guide. Jaipur is very nice and full of nice sites that I wouldn’t be able to tour myself", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/8750877/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/8750878/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-2-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with-cab-guide/8750879/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Paulina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Very good guides, Kalhed and Davinder were fantastic. Knowledgeable and patient. They were always on time! I would highly recommend booking this tours." },
      { author: "Shamsher", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-18", text: "Very friendly and helpful people. Very knowledgeable and professional." },
      { author: "Mukund", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "A big shout-out to Manoj, our amazing tour operator in Jaipur! From start to finish, he made our trip smooth, comfortable, and truly memorable. His knowledge, patience, and friendly nature added so much value to our experience. Every spot he took us to, every detail he managed all were perfect. Highly recommended for anyone visiting Jaipur! Thank you, Manoj, for making our journey special." },
      { author: "Javier", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "Our guide, Kk, was exceptionally knowledgeable and made the experience both informative and engaging. He was very accommodating to our specific plans and tailored our two-day tour to our preferences and schedule, including multiple visits to a tailor where we decided to have clothes made. Our driver, Suresh, was equally professional, knowledgeable, and attentive. We highly recommend this team for a truly personalized and seamless experience." },
      { author: "Gernot", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-21", text: "We had an interesting tour and the tour operator went above and beyond in fulfilling out requests." },
      { author: "Helmut", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-04", text: "Raghuvir was very polite, friendly and helpful. Answered all our questions. Got us to the Elephant sancturary. Showed us a goot restaurant for lunch. Alwasy asking for our preferences and offering options. Also Suresh was a good driver. Thank you for the tour!!" },
    ],
  },
