  'jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes': {
    averageRating: 4.83,
    totalReviews: 18,
    guideRating: 4.83,
    valueRating: 4.67,
    reviews: [
      { author: "SARII", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-28", text: "Thank Asif for great time! I just shared the places I wanted to visit and the food I wanted to try, and Asif customized everything for me. It made for such a fun evening experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/7374447/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/7374448/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/7374449/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Walking around the pink town and old city with asif was very informative and there wasn’t a question he couldn’t answer, he showed me hidden parts of the city like the yellow town. We enjoyed some local street food and had the best tea I’ve ever had, 10/10 would book again", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6639996/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6639997/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6639998/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Stephen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Asif was very knowledgable. Happy to take questions. Even went as far as to show us some of the less familiar elements as we requested.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6444590/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6444591/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6444594/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "We had a great time! We learned a lot and enjoyed samosas and Chai. My favorite thing was watching bangle making. Would definitely recommend Asif as your tour guide! Our guide and rickshaw drivers were really fun!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5748764/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5748765/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Natasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "We had a fantastic tour with Asif in the evening in the hidden lanes of Jaipur. We tried the famous Indian whiskey (masala chai)! Thank you for a wonderful evening. Highly recommend for anyone visiting Jaipur this tour is not to be missed!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5742900/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Vincent", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-04", text: "This is a must after the daytime tour of Jaipur. A different experience and perspective of the lively city. Amazing street foods!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5386419/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5386423/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/5386424/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Floriane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "el tour con Najish fue muy interesante, visitamos el barrio amarillo, pasamos a dentro de las calles donde viven los locales. nos compró comida y bebidas típicas. sabe mucho de la historia y le gusta compartir. lo recomiendo mucho", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6162795/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6162797/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-by-night-food-walk-art-hidden-lanes/6162798/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Very interesting walk around old city streets and bazaars with a chance to see some workshops and courtyards where families live. Guide was informative and helpful." },
      { author: "Anirban", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "I had a fantastic experience with Ram Avtar, my guide. He really knows this place well. Showed me through the bustling streets of old city, pointing significance of each landmarks and houses. Overall, extremely satisfied with the tour." },
      { author: "Allyson", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "Lovely tour with Asif who was very knowledgeable about Jaipur and its history. He had a lovely gentle manner and had arranged for us to be picked up from our hotel and taken to the meeting place. We walked the through the craft markets of the old town and saw bangles being made. We also walked past the beautiful Hawa Mahal all lit up. We tasted masala chai, the best pakori from a street food shop we would never have found on our own and then ate tandoori naan and Dahl from a local restaurant. Well done Asif for a great informative tour and thanks to Max for the excellent transportation." },
      { author: "Giuseppa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-19", text: "Super nice tour with Asif, full of tastes, colours and experiences! I really recommend it :-)" },
      { author: "Cal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-10", text: "Asif was a great tour guide and very knowledgeable of the city of Japiur, I would recommend his services 100%" },
    ],
  },
  'jaipur-car-tour-english-speaking-local-driver': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-01", text: "I did this private car tour with Naresh and honestly had a really good day out! The car was clean, comfy and properly air conditioned, which made a huge difference in the Jaipur heat. We hit the big sights like Amber Fort, Jal Mahal and Hawa Mahal, but the best parts were the little side streets, viewpoints and chai stops he took me to that I never would’ve found on my own. Naresh’s English is excellent and he’s really easy to talk to, so planning the day was simple. He checked what I was interested in, mixed in some shopping and photo stops, and never made anything feel rushed. I felt safe, looked after and like I was seeing the “real” Jaipur rather than just being dropped at tourist traps. If you want a relaxed, flexible way to see the city with a local who knows it inside out, I’d definitely recommend this tour." },
      { author: "Kirsty", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-13", text: "Rauf was a fantastic guide. He showed us some great spots we didn’t even know before. Very flexible to adapt the tour to your needs. Very glad we booked this and got to see everything Rauf showed us :)" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-19", text: "Naresh ji was excellent and most knowledgeable." },
    ],
  },
