    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Julie Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "wonderful expierience , i will remember this all my days , the manager was a ton of fun ,highly reccomend this place", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-ethical-elephant-care-sanctuary-experience/5990694/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "The experience was amazing, pickup was on time which is rarely the case, then getting to the elephant village was quick, when we arrived got to meet the first elephant, Rangoli, took her for a walk around the grounds, then back to start point at where I got to feed her, after I met my second elephant ledu, and this was to clean her, I ended up soaked but what an experience! I don’t know if I got ledu more wet than if ledu got me wet 😂 it was an amazing experience! Big thanks to Najish the manager and Imran the guide who helped walk the elephant and took all the photos for me!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Just finished my amazing trip to elephants village with Najish. We met beautiful elephant Chanda. U can feed,hug,ride an elephant. The best activity is to wash her. You wash elephant and after Chanda washes u! 100% recommend this place. The best guide you can go there is Najish. Everything was perfect! 5 star tour!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Wir haben uns sehr spontan für diese Tour entschieden und die Organisation war wunderbar und hat auf anhieb geklappt. wir wurden von unserem Hotel eine Stunde nach Ankunft abgeholt und sehr nett empfangen. Auf dem Weg zum Elevantendorf hat uns unser Guide Interessantes über Jaiour erzählt und erklärt und das auf eine sehr unterhaltsame Weise. Das Elevantendorf ist sehr sauber und die Elevanten werden sehr umsorgt." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Very good experience, friendly staff, amazing elephants" },
    ],
