  'jaipur-instagram-tour-of-the-top-photography-spots': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 5,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-17", text: "Thank you for the today's tour! The tour guide to Amber palace was nice, he was an excellent photographer. Also the driver Manoj was quite helpful during the tour. I recommend this tour!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-instagram-tour-of-the-top-photography-spots/8770607/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Margaux", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-31", text: "J’ai effectué une prestation ce matin avec ce guide et je tiens vraiment à souligner son professionnalisme et son humanité. Il a été extrêmement compréhensif vis-à-vis de mon état de santé, m’a aidé il était parfaitement conscient que la situation était difficile pour moi. Même si nous n’avons pas pu faire l’ensemble des activités prévues initialement, il a su s’adapter totalement à ma condition, sans pression, avec beaucoup de bienveillance pour me proposer un accompagnement unique sur mesure. J’ai vraiment eu le sentiment d’être accompagnée par quelqu’un qui propose un service authentiquement personnalisé, centré sur la personne et son état de santé et non par quelqu’un qui cherche simplement à encaisser comme deux autres guides que j’ai contacté aujourd’hui pour annuler. Une rencontre rare et précieuse. Un vrai professionnel. Mon conseil : passez par lui, et fuyez les autres guides!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-instagram-tour-of-the-top-photography-spots/5349457/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-instagram-tour-of-the-top-photography-spots/5349458/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-instagram-tour-of-the-top-photography-spots/5349459/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Charlotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "Great tour of the city and points of interest, with an excellent guide who also speaks French and Maliq the driver who is truly the best. I was able to take some great photos with him and I thank him very much, he is awesome. I will call on him again when I return to Jaipur with friends. It was a wonderful day and I am delighted with this experience." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-20", text: "He is very knowledgeable about Jaipur. Make sure to take water as it gets very hot. It would be better without the compulsory stop at the shop where you feel the pressure to buy things. I never appreciated such in any of the tours but here it is part of the journey. Be prepared." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Genial! nos encanto a todos" },
    ],
  },
