  'jaipur-private-full-day-city-sightseeing-tour-with': {
    averageRating: 4.86,
    totalReviews: 37,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.57,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Alexandre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2022-04-08", text: "I had an amazing experience! Both the driver Manoj and the guide are extraordinary professionals, they were always polite, welcoming, friendly, and so attentive. They did everything they could to please me and make me feel comfortable. I was alone on the tour and they made me feel very safe, I would definitely recommend it. Thank you to all the team involved and an special thank you to Manoj for being such an amazing guy." },
      { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2021-02-16", text: "We loved our experience with Janu Private Tours! Janu and Rajesh were amazing. They know Jaipur inside and out and were just a joy to be around. It was like our friends were giving us a tour of their hometown. We’ll be returning to Jaipur specifically to see more sights with this company. We didn’t realize how much we’d love Jaipur but I credit Janu and Rajesh with making us want to come back." },
      { author: "Ryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-04-03", text: "This tour was really outstanding! I was fetched in a lovely vintage car from the Marigold Hotel movie by Rakesh which marked the beginning of the exciting trip. The tour guide, Krishna, was truly a knowledgeable man not just in terms of the history of Jaipur and India, but also the detailed astronomical science at Jantar Mantar! Over and beyond the amazing places of interest that Krishna and Rakesh awed me with, they also took the trouble to help me with my pharmaceutical needs. The lunch provided was definitely good quality and I enjoyed it very much! Absolutely loved this trip which has left with me very beautiful memories of Jaipur city and a wonderful impression of India too! I would highly recommend this inspiring trip to anyone who wants to get to know Jaipur! Thank you so much again, Krishna and Rakesh! :-)" },
      { author: "István", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-01-08", text: "“Amazing tour with a great guide (Akram) and driver (Rakesh). Very polite, on time in a clean and safe car. Knowledgeable and very helpful guide who is not only doing the standard but is showing the hidden gems - couldn’t have explored all of that without him. Excellent service, highly recommended!”" },
      { author: "Indu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-10-16", text: "Excellent trip thanks to Kamal and Ayub Khan of Janu Private Tours. Best of luck! Ayub Khan is a great person. He showed me all the important places worthwhile visiting. I appreciate his attentiveness to my needs as I’m a senior citizen . Kamal was very proactive in his approach and suggested a very good tour for my first day. I booked my tours through tripAdviser" },
      { author: "Lilia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-07-21", text: "Great day with driver and guide who were very nice and helpful for me !" },
      { author: "Kareem", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-07-10", text: "Brilliant tour by Kumar and Nizam, they really made me fall in love with this rich city. You will get to see the main attractions, take pictures, and really feel what Jaipur has to offer. You will definitely not regret your day, especially if it’s with these 2." },
      { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-04-24", text: "This tour was without a doubt the best of all our experience in India. Rakesh our driver great and was so friendly, he provided cooled water all day and after the tour took us to the elephant village for no extra charge just because we said we wanted to go. We ended up getting a lift from him all the way to Delhi for our flight a few days later! Our guide was also great, very informative and polite and took loads of great photos with us. I have seen other reviews that say this was only a half day tour, but its as long as you make it, we were out over 12 hours with our guide and driver in the end. Also the guide gave us a choice of price range and type of food for lunch which is unusual for tours like this and was very welcome! We ended up going to a very cheap traditional Rajasthani restaurant that was absolutely delicious. Furthermore, we didn't have enough cash to cover our lunch so Rakesh kindly subbed us the money and took us on a tour of several atms for us to get cash out after!" },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-03-10", text: "I had a fabulous day with Janu and Surya visiting the sites of Jaipur. Surya is so knowledgeable about the city and the history and helped to make places like the Amber Fort come alive to see how the kings and queens actually lived there. Both Janu and Surya could not do enough to make sure I enjoyed the day...greeting me with a rose garland and even hunting down a cold Diet Coke for me! The last stop of the day was to a textile factory where I learned about how camel hair carpets are made and how they block print fabric and even bought a tailor-made outfit that was delivered later in the evening directly to my hotel! I know that most tours (all tours) include some kind of ‘retail opportunity’ but this was actually interesting and there was no pressure to buy. (I had already told Janu I was interested in buying an outfit) Finally, Janu has also organised further transport for me for my return to Delhi. He really is super helpful and kind." },
      { author: "Max", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-02-07", text: "The guide called Mr Surya was great. I strongly reccomend him." },
      { author: "Chandhanarat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-10-05", text: "The driver: on time, drove safely, polite. The guide (Jacki): knowledgable, has service mind and flexible plan" },
      { author: "Etienne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2018-10-03", text: "The guide (Subya) and driver (Rakesh) were both very professional and courteous. I was 5 minutes early and they were already waiting for me. The guide was well informed and expressed himself clearly. He was also very patient and let me take my time to take many pictures. I'm really thankful for that! They did not mind that I wanted to skip souvenir shopping, unlike some other tours. In the end I was very satisfied with this quick introduction to Jaipur and the history of its dynasty. Also, I might add that the same company assisted me a custom travel back to Delhi with a sunset viewpoint stop. They were very flexible and offered a fair price. Thank you!" },
    ],
  },
