  'sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-': {
    averageRating: 4.9,
    totalReviews: 2279,
    guideRating: 4.9,
    valueRating: 4.76,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Ishani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-03", text: "The day trip was great, timely pickup. The guide Imtiaz was also good and knowledgeable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/5680301/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/5680302/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/5680303/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Vaneeta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-07", text: "My husband and I had a full day private tour today. We saw the Taj at sunrise and many more monuments during the day. Imtiaz was our tour guide and I cannot express how good of a tour guide! My husband and I have travelled quite a lot and we often source tours as a way to understand the country and culture. Without a doubt Imtiaz is the most knowledgeable guide I have ever had! We learnt so much about the Taj Mahal, the culture and the history of the country. I feel very very lucky we had such great weather and a fantastic guide. We were taken to a wonderful food place and had no issues with the food!! I would recommend this tour and if you can I would highly urge you to have Imtiaz!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/5409435/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Luke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-14", text: "We have just finished a fantastic day tour with Somaan, super knowledgeable and curated a fantastic day for our group. Would highly recommend if you are planning a trip to Taj/Agra", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/4222084/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/4222085/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/4222086/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Aleksandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-07", text: "Sadiq, thank you very much for this excursion! Stories and walking in Taj Mahal was amazing, your Russian is great, and also you are a wonderful photographer, I recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/sameday-taj-mahal-mathura-vrindavan-from-delhi-by-/3327389/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jose", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-28", text: "Guide Vishal is very knowledgeable and friendly. He has a lot of information on all the monuments visited. Taj Mahal, Agra fort, and baby Taj were all in the itinerary and at a calm pace. He goes at your pace and you choose your own adventure. Food was a nice Indian breakfast at a nice place. Driver, Hardip very patient, plenty of water, and good driving." },
      { author: "Ross", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Had an amazing day with my guide Sadiq and driver Sukhbir. Sadiq was polite, funny and had great knowledge on all the different monuments we visited. Sukhbir also provided such an easy and comfortable ride throughout the day. As a solo traveller I feel like this is the best way to make the most of your day, learn a lot about the different spots and make sure you know about local adjustments. Would highly recommend." },
      { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "We had an incredible day with Amaan. His English is excellent and he knows everything about Indian history. He was very fun and interesting to talk to and we felt super comfortable the whole time. He tailored the trip to our needs and wants too. This was our best tour in India so far! Would highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Ajay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-15", text: "Our family of four had a wonderful experience from start to finish. Our driver, Monu, was incredibly professional and kind, and the car was kept in pristine, excellent condition. In Agra, our guide, Faisal, proved to be both knowledgeable and highly professional. We will certainly recommend this company to our friends and look forward to booking with them again for our upcoming trip to Jaipur." },
      { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Sadik has been an excellent host and tour guide. We visited the Taj, Baby Taj, Fort Agra. We saw amazing artisans doing the same gem/stone work as what’s completed on the Taj. The entire trip has been informative, fun and wonderful." },
      { author: "Mette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-25", text: "It was an amazing experience and our guide Faisal was super great. Clear to hear he has been here so many times and was super good at directing and showing us around in a nice pace :-) It was an absolute great day!" },
      { author: "Allison Ann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-05", text: "As a solo female traveler, I would definitely recommend this tour. Even though it was an early start it was so worth it. Had a lovely time seeing Taj Mahal, Agra Fort and Baby Taj. Kevin was very informative and the pace of the tour was just right. Enough time to see and hear about everything but still moving along. I liked that I had the option to make the tour as long or as short as I wanted. It was very interesting to see the stone inlay work and to get to take a little mini piece of Taj home with me. Kevin and/or my driver were always with me and made sure I felt comfortable and safe. Lunch was delicious!" },
      { author: "Karolina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-05", text: "That was a really wonderful trip! My guide Ankur Sharma has a huge knowledge about the history of India and he knows a lot of great stories related to the monuments and places. As I am solo woman traveller, I felt really safe. Thank you so much for this amazing trip! I’l definitely come back." },
    ],
  },
